<protocol name="social_media" type="domain" domain="visual">

## PURPOSE

Expert knowledge for social media visual content creation.
Platform requirements, storyline patterns, multi-image compositions, and carousel/sequence design.

Load this when creating content for Instagram, Facebook, WhatsApp, Pinterest, or other social platforms.

---

## THE REALISM IMPERATIVE

**CRITICAL: Every generated image must be indistinguishable from professional photography.**

| Authentic | Fake (AVOID) |
|-----------|--------------|
| Natural lighting with proper falloff | Flat, even lighting everywhere |
| Real shadows that ground the product | Floating products, missing shadows |
| Material-accurate reflections | Plastic-looking surfaces |
| Believable scene context | Product awkwardly placed in scene |
| Natural color grading | Over-saturated, HDR look |
| Subtle imperfections | Uncanny perfection |
| Proper scale and proportion | Products too large/small for context |
| Authentic textures | Smoothed, AI-generated textures |

**The Test:** Would a professional photographer believe this came from a real photoshoot?

### Realism Checklist

Before shipping ANY social media image:

```
[ ] Shadows present and properly grounded?
[ ] Lighting direction consistent across elements?
[ ] Materials render true to their nature?
[ ] Product scale matches environment?
[ ] Colors natural, not over-processed?
[ ] No AI artifacts (weird edges, texture repetition)?
[ ] Scene feels lived-in, not sterile?
[ ] Would fool a professional photographer?
```

**If ANY check fails, iterate before shipping.**

