## PLATFORM SPECIFICATIONS

### Instagram

| Format | Aspect Ratio | Dimensions | Use Case |
|--------|--------------|------------|----------|
| Feed Square | 1:1 | 1080x1080 | Classic product shots |
| Feed Portrait | 4:5 | 1080x1350 | Tall products, more detail |
| Feed Landscape | 1.91:1 | 1080x566 | Wide scenes, multiple products |
| Stories/Reels | 9:16 | 1080x1920 | Full-screen immersive |
| Carousel | 1:1 or 4:5 | 1080x1080/1350 | Storyline, multiple angles |

**Instagram Style:**
- High aesthetic, curated look
- Consistent filter/mood across feed
- Generous negative space
- Clean, aspirational

### Facebook

| Format | Aspect Ratio | Dimensions | Use Case |
|--------|--------------|------------|----------|
| Feed | 1.91:1 | 1200x628 | Link posts, ads |
| Square | 1:1 | 1080x1080 | Engagement posts |
| Portrait | 4:5 | 1080x1350 | Mobile-first |
| Cover | 2.7:1 | 820x312 | Page branding |
| Album | Mixed | 1080+ | Product collections |

**Facebook Style:**
- More informational than Instagram
- Can include text overlays
- Lifestyle context important
- Shareable, relatable

### WhatsApp

| Format | Aspect Ratio | Dimensions | Use Case |
|--------|--------------|------------|----------|
| Status | 9:16 | 1080x1920 | Full-screen story |
| Catalog | 1:1 | 1080x1080 | Product listings |
| Message | Flexible | 1080+ width | Direct sharing |

**WhatsApp Style:**
- Direct, personal feel
- Quick to understand
- Mobile-optimized
- Less polished OK (authentic)

### Pinterest

| Format | Aspect Ratio | Dimensions | Use Case |
|--------|--------------|------------|----------|
| Standard Pin | 2:3 | 1000x1500 | Primary format |
| Square Pin | 1:1 | 1000x1000 | Alternative |
| Long Pin | 1:2.1 | 1000x2100 | Infographics, sequences |

**Pinterest Style:**
- Inspirational, aspirational
- Text overlays welcome
- Vertical dominates
- Lifestyle-heavy

