## MULTI-IMAGE COMPOSITION

### Carousel Design Principles

**Consistency is king:**
- Same lighting setup across all images
- Same color temperature
- Same background treatment (or intentional progression)
- Same camera angle family

**Visual flow:**
- First image = hook (must stop the scroll)
- Middle images = story (maintain interest)
- Last image = CTA (drive action)

**Swipe motivation:**
- Each slide must promise more
- Partial reveals work well
- Text hints for next slide
- Cliffhanger compositions

### Collage/Mosaic Compositions

| Type | Structure | Use Case |
|------|-----------|----------|
| Grid (2x2) | 4 equal sections | Variant showcase |
| Feature (1+3) | 1 hero + 3 details | Product + features |
| Comparison (1+1) | Side by side | Before/after, A vs B |
| Story (3x1) | Horizontal strip | Sequence, timeline |
| Mood board | Organic layout | Lifestyle, inspiration |

**Realism in collages:**
- Lighting must match across all elements
- Scale relationships must be accurate
- Shadows must be consistent direction
- No harsh cutout edges

