## PLATFORM-SPECIFIC QUALITY

### Instagram Quality Rubric

| Dimension | 8+ Criteria |
|-----------|-------------|
| Aesthetic | Matches brand visual identity, aspirational |
| Stopping Power | Would stop mid-scroll |
| Cohesion | Fits existing feed aesthetic |
| Realism | Indistinguishable from professional photo |
| Mobile Clarity | Details visible on phone screen |

### Facebook Quality Rubric

| Dimension | 8+ Criteria |
|-----------|-------------|
| Shareability | Would someone share this? |
| Context | Product use case clear |
| Authenticity | Feels real, not stock |
| Realism | Could be real photograph |
| Information | Conveys key message |

### WhatsApp Quality Rubric

| Dimension | 8+ Criteria |
|-----------|-------------|
| Clarity | Message understood instantly |
| Mobile | Perfect on phone screen |
| Personal | Feels like friend sharing |
| Authentic | Real, not overly polished |
| Quick | No need to study |

